egory":"cafe","text":"这个地方看起来很适合休息呢","text_original":"休息にはちょうど良さそうな場所ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/0RYnJ7IcP9y54TJipcs9WImsvtiRG26I.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"偶尔这样也不错。","text_original":"たまにはこういった時間も、悪くありません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/21zJHOQO1tZi2ygK0CqErPxBtnzlGMB0.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"老师，在哪里……","text_original":"先生は、どこに……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/upHBdjktWzqr055Vb1qWwoJ4BXVl1pXN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"希望我能帮上忙。","text_original":"お役に立ちましたら幸いです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/EMDtLbjmD3hGdhXYvPIfwhU7DnbRYUBB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_CommonTSASkill","category":"other","text":"尸体……啊，不，伤员请放这边。","text_original":"した……いえ、負傷者はこちらえ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/qC9wu3I7vX4Y9xIcqJwwWeK6VsgjhgPa.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_1","category":"event","text":"……老师？请专心工作。","text_original":"……先生？お仕事に集中してください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/UeF0FMapemIHWMmbiylzVtFZaTh8EES8.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_2","category":"event","text":"……很抱歉，不过，我不能替您做这项工作。","text_original":"……すみませんが、私がお仕事を肩代わりすることはできませんので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/YyPwk0q6bGX2J8DXzLaNvNdsJNwxqukf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_Day_End","category":"event","text":"今天的工作就这些，老师，您辛苦了。","text_original":"では、ほんじつのおしごとは以上です。先生、お疲れ様でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/TIQssFRw9Vhmv5IQuZ7KEgfluHkq8iwp.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_Get_1","category":"event","text":"是，已经确认过了。","text_original":"はい、確認しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/7pqsYkISinHT30zT5f0ena9BMZqNc6F2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_Get_2","category":"event","text":"已经处理好了。","text_original":"問題なく終えられたようですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/naVc9vBz4duSKQmhT8P7Jokk8b3hIdB4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_Login_1","category":"event","text":"老师，很高兴见到您。这是这次工作的任务清单，还请多多关照。","text_original":"お疲れ様です、先生。こちらお仕事のリストですので、よろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/jNi1HCApjCBXjEkzEgmiN0mSKvwFmZgu.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventMission_Login_2","category":"event","text":"这是目前的工作进展情况，请您确认一下。","text_original":"こちら、お仕事の進捗状況です。ご確認をお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/KOiabMY5d47CcDyZnA7zPqGilgDmqv3M.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_1","category":"event","text":"……以防万一，我要提醒您，我并不是商品。","text_original":"……念のため、ですが。私は商品ではありませんので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/hgWy4HGhMtecWbggsVRzDaJdlVmvWE1Q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_2","category":"event","text":"很抱歉，根据规定不能直接送给您。","text_original":"申し訳ありませんが規則ですので、無料で差し上げる訳にはいきません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/UmYei12DuOAlT710OdNw9dodVy15FR77.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Buy_1","category":"event","text":"明智的判断。","text_original":"悪くない判断です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/9biYQXlrOidHgUWD1ktbMQPmQ79UVcRR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Buy_2","category":"event","text":"我觉得那个挺好的。","text_original":"それが良さそうですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/cRuCivuu2KkS0z41QoMVeVelFe4Yzo5n.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Buy_3","category":"event","text":"我这就去准备。","text_original":"すぐに用意します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/vYJ4TOEoH9Sn2RNsdsttqLxJFvtAHZj3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Buy_4","category":"event","text":"好的，请稍等。","text_original":"はい、では少々お待ちください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/PO4oUCHrSpKIQgqqguy44KkJa6gszQnS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_End","category":"event","text":"我觉得有必要采取后续措施，所以留了下来。 有什么需要请尽管告诉我。","text_original":"事後処理が発生するのではと思い、ここに残っておりました。 何かありましたらいつでもお声がけください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/Am1rtMGPG4Kcjsh8r02zQOMacH1wcQPH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Login_1","category":"event","text":"老师，您辛苦了。 有什么需要请尽管告诉我。","text_original":"お疲れ様です、先生。 何かありましたらいつでも声をかけてください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/YBLlrETdF2pPJEtPDjCoPFS7Di6isOMz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_EventShop_Login_2","category":"event","text":"……现场乱糟糟的，也许提前做好准备比较好。","text_original":"……騒がしい現場ですね。準備をしておいた方が良いかもしれません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/zS7IkugBbh2wCIkmcFvF67s5qp6fwehT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"情况确认完毕。","text_original":"状況の確認完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/TxLJctSdVBUPkXg8X4dl6SD6vHk5rIO2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"明白了。","text_original":"了解しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/Pk4pVJrt8x10SkUsHYjFVtAH5tu3ClOx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"情况已确认。","text_original":"確認しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/kGAHV8iLoxc4VUmnLQIZadBe0MVho4Vk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"出动。","text_original":"出動します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/apKItkF3JKZvhMVbWAXgCdpYWcnG3gPN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"马上出发。","text_original":"すぐに向かいます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/yA1d0dCJWoC4uKVyCJpG1vOhM5d4nos5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"正在赶往现场。","text_original":"現場に急行します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/90yMUCaightJoj64gTVigXlLZWOKMfcC.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"希望我能帮上忙。","text_original":"こちらの装備、確かに受け取りました。これからはより本格的な支援ができるはずです。……これからも、どうかよろしくお願いいたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/iORACjG42uDv7IjkALS7RhQCuhKFStcO.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"已准备就绪。","text_original":"準備はできています。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/ltgXvDVIpolAkXK6CEbCP5ONUWylDnfP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"待命中，请随时联系我。","text_original":"待機中です。いつでもお呼びください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/NGTZ7IITiWn3dYqJEFOW0VqCd5OBz1ht.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是歌赫娜急救医学部部长冰室濑名。请多关照。","text_original":"ゲヘナ学園救急医学部の部長、氷室セナです。以後お見知りおきを。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/tsdQZ53VbmyHThr38ouBf9uOtnM8gqaS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"谢谢，您的支援绝对不会白费。","text_original":"ありがとうございます。この支援、無駄にはしません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/fKxXIOJ66o3ufDDdYF5jdhEm52PT9yyD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我的能力提升了。","text_original":"能力が向上しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/kPmWWEwqmoetvi4V5784lQSmXWOelxMG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢谢，我会用这份力量，好好回报您。","text_original":"ありがとうございます。この力を使って、きちんと恩返しいたしますので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/0Y7kufTuGWYaOtRc6eYI8dMRuquTDaXc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢，多亏了您，以后工作应该会更轻松了。","text_original":"助かります。おかげさまで、今後は一層やりやすくなるはずです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/OssVkd0KHqWj5sYjcH3PNomo9SLP4jGV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"您叫我吗？ 就算是不起眼的私事也可以的。","text_original":"……お呼びですか？ 大したことではなくても、何なら個人的な用事でも構いませんが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/nA7MGYSn4gPGqY2FPUVoakcSWLqunUdf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"我们通常只负责救治伤员，也就是外科治疗。 感冒之类的，不在我们的业务范围内。","text_original":"基本的に私たちは身体の傷、すなわち外科を専門としています。 ですので、風邪などは管轄外ですよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/4ZIXGwvA88nQT8nPMiKQ9nngxv03qETf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我很习惯等待。 也很习惯接到紧急呼叫后出动。","text_original":"待つことには慣れていますから。 それと、急に呼び出されることにも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/rekOIH2H5hH5xlCHgxJKGxTzonYhflH9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"能站在这个位置…… 我能理解为，得到了您的信任吗？","text_original":"この場所に立っているということは、 それくらい信頼されていると解釈しても良いですか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/nOWzYSt8dlShuhRpoaexLFBF0egMpRux.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"现在好像无事发生呢……能休息时就多休息一下吧。","text_original":"今は特に何も起きてないようですね。……休める時に休んでおきますか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/qUVKFIU6W3YC0hZvZpYSWYiO4VrPGAMz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您辛苦了。我正等着您呢。","text_original":"お疲れ様です、先生。お待ちしていました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/2FLZFcmsxSCCDTrp1kyxYIzsHosTgKrF.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"全部准备就绪。老师，尽管吩咐吧。","text_original":"準備はできていますので。何でもお申し付けください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/9YpMdjYgHiLNvI5cKUVM8FrR3s632bhW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"……不介意的话，要和我一起吃吗？虽然是在便利店买的……","text_original":"……よろしければこちら、ご一緒にいかがですか？コンビニのものですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/vzWzYMQU3fXCEEQGC7MrFoR7sWNEWNHx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为必须这样待命，所以只好简单应付一下。","text_original":"こうして待機していなければならなかったので、簡単なもので済ませてしまおうかと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/Ad3d58fkrQvZmACM08qohsS6QmYPHQyi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"话说回来，老师为什么会来这里？是有什么事吗……？","text_original":"ところで、先生はどうされたのですか。こんなところで……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/MahBfKvHjxnoUcPi7s4z58Ra8eWn74lR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？觉得我很辛苦？……所以特意过来给我加油吗？","text_original":"……はい？大変そうだから、労おうと思って……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/a1Pk5JgCV256x4WxUHWjiCCXstAhcLZs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"原来如此，是这样啊。","text_original":"……なるほど、そうでしたか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/1bDiQQVrrCzpgOyxhIT4pFpPralxIX82.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"特地跑到这种地方来……谢谢您。老师。","text_original":"……わざわざこんなところまで、ありがとうございます。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/sZ3vQLbyj2c4R0roRQEi4Xoie6XIluot.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然事情的发展出乎了我的意料……","text_original":"予期せぬ展開ではありましたが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/MBtMgr07afQA0YCfykcO6YiFbuLRnmIY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"但是能像这样和老师待在一起，我真的很开心。","text_original":"先生とこうしていられるのは、素直に嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/SURDf7yudS0vkEtj6ZmdJdCbC2kXlvUg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"谢谢您，一直这么关心我。","text_original":"いつも気を遣ってくださいますね。ありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/v5fNxzNCDLrboCO1zhfg2smq2QaQniWR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"我还不太习惯像这样说下别人的东西，不过，我很开心。","text_original":"こうして何かを頂くのは、慣れていないのですが…はい、嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/hbRR114LRlpLZqPU6U2cvuu1nHXt2mCs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"会这么频繁和我接触的，只有老师您了。您真是一个不可思议的人。","text_original":"これほどまでに私に頻繁に接してくるのは、先生くらいです。不思議な方ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/QQQZe7hLclXBONHTJo3dMmXFNJSEPCw7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"也许是因为和老师接触的比较多，最近我经常会想起您，在各种场合。","text_original":"こうして接する機会が多いせいか、最近はよく先生のことを考えています。色々と。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/wsHlmgUsRSSecu0zxgxMUXsdPRK313zQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"说起来，今天是我的生日。 啊……只是向您报告一下。","text_original":"……そういえば今日は、私の誕生日でしたね。 いえ、ただ言ってみただけなのですが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/Qhw4lorSYF4RG6YuP7t7mYEzSsVpW4Rc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"……您是说……祝我生日快乐？ ……谢谢，我很开心。","text_original":"あっ……祝って、くださるんですか？ ……ありがとうございます、嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/jVNSRl5iJB4Cij7aENOkKG3xeXbqG3Kg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。 今天是个值得庆祝的日子，希望能平安无事。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。 今日という良き日を、怪我も事故も無く過ごせることを願っていますよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/LIJZ2KdEBXDPdyztCXsNrYt9TI8p50R1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"热闹的节日里难免会发生各种事故，我得时刻做好准备。","text_original":"こういった騒がしい日に、事故や怪我はつきものです。準備をしておかないと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/yLRwKIHTgJReh7MookmEtZg5XGbo5Brb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"不知不觉已经是新年了。 老师，新的一年也请多多关照。","text_original":"気づいたらいつの間にか、年が明けていましたね。 この新しい一年も、よろしくお願いいたします。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/V6JRMgfuH0rDIGP3rrkH3zSBoTPdk9q2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊……虽然是个美好的日子， 但对于我们来说，也是比平时更加忙碌的一天。","text_original":"クリスマス……良い日なのかもしれませんが 実は私たちにとっては、普段より忙しくなりがちな一日です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/TvwTGoCEkg54kID84YYeBns5Xo85Ma0D.ogg"},{"description":"CH0081_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果要送我礼物的话，那我想得到只属于一人…… 呃不，是只属于两人的安宁时光。","text_original":"もしプレゼントを貰えるとしたらひとりの時間…… いえ、ふたりっきりの落ち着いた時間が欲しいですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/LxI4KgZZB0kPNt28Dvx4wAwkwlaQGOC4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"なるほど……移送時の参考にします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/original/jp/ch0081_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0081_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"是，已经确认过了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/zvtQW5EbyXi2usyuDrdcHKFL9f4TgypF.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"已经处理好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/