atic.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/EcShJG0Ea7Lnpii9zdsULi7z7kQX429D.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我很习惯等待。 也很习惯接到紧急呼叫后出动。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/88tA7Zp1ZWVY5bD8sJvZJEgNEHQ6f6xE.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"能站在这个位置…… 我能理解为，得到了您的信任吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/w95YbcxbvINrbb6zlBy7KEU8H4Mk2ZMD.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"现在好像无事发生呢……能休息时就多休息一下吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/SJkUjxcJ7ueAi1a8Vrcl4Yl1iLrF0LzT.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您辛苦了。我正等着您呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/MMwyWfNEAdmtNYfVowO3HoObx7yKVJeR.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"全部准备就绪。老师，尽管吩咐吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/65DaGXAs1AaLpErx60UeXRnB9paPQpbL.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"……不介意的话，要和我一起吃吗？虽然是在便利店买的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/OGpCcKAqZpvNyS1uT1lncZNQMH9UECSJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为必须这样待命，所以只好简单应付一下。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/jv9DpMgvvBuZ8ybz1aXMyfBPzWuWPMbY.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"话说回来，老师为什么会来这里？是有什么事吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/yjD8ArgeJ6kCnb1ZB2vUfVvjOhDxTMpk.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？觉得我很辛苦？……所以特意过来给我加油吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/YO294Zc8vW7pNk5F81Zhn7vqcyW7cJl9.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"原来如此，是这样啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/4KMtdBj0bSiKLQqZtCIoUCFIJrQdSn1c.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"特地跑到这种地方来……谢谢您。老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/uX7xW4K3ehHkPrZK7NLelFKSo86Niunl.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然事情的发展出乎了我的意料……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/KtN38QLyEiUQAdbzL71XohujDLRhAy3k.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"但是能像这样和老师待在一起，我真的很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/lpv80d69FIr47xUNt49QTLhtWPrJXtxk.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"谢谢您，一直这么关心我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/LmOK7EcWDF0fc3mJBb9KL46CZO4v9H9I.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"我还不太习惯像这样说下别人的东西，不过，我很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/HpjXmT1Q6bGeYjmZ4mcTIrbtFNEIV6Dn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"会这么频繁和我接触的，只有老师您了。您真是一个不可思议的人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/E76SJU91wckgyDkJyqilgTpisYsfQFmc.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"也许是因为和老师接触的比较多，最近我经常会想起您，在各种场合。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/2EWL83TePeY5e4ScHHymlOKjgTW6svYm.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"说起来，今天是我的生日。 啊……只是向您报告一下。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/iZEoNAyldhiMGK1MvSVds5isL7JayYHE.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"……您是说……祝我生日快乐？ ……谢谢，我很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/EhveJ0yb8nXUm53XTdsB6cDuQaph4BGc.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。 今天是个值得庆祝的日子，希望能平安无事。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/m68HLTqJYAPn6mVdWouoXnVGQr6xTITl.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐。新的一年，祝您健康平安。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/yifgrEaLIODMe0fcgL0zjB0vFoZgdi9r.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"热闹的节日里难免会发生各种事故，我得时刻做好准备。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/oIr1UEQgnDaVHu58FbDszExTnt6jAdsV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"即使是这样的节日，我依旧会为了预防伤员出现而待命。不过，有老师陪着，已经是一种团圆了吧。谢谢您，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/k53YXocgL4mhCdr2dJhDVCPws4eI7lym.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"不知不觉已经是新年了。 老师，新的一年也请多多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/ceQ8h3uPmdYpuUPCPEObce0VopjS5FrB.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊……虽然是个美好的日子， 但对于我们来说，也是比平时更加忙碌的一天。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/hlyrgS1HKaALR6qlDDP2SqqFHTEYK1qx.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果要送我礼物的话，那我想得到只属于一人…… 呃不，是只属于两人的安宁时光。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/aocUDKiEJmkNDKH2pQp1kU9WpfIDo2J2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Achive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/1z1THjuQBQDfd0Jzec1ctkTW3ZLyIvvW.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……这边看起来没有异常。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/Gw1XvywZ8VbwyuJLVVhmxsiHuRQmXM2U.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"似乎没有尸体……啊不，没有伤员啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/tRHuDEUa4GvsUzFAxo9QkCY5HnMeq3rx.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"这个地方看起来很适合休息呢","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/56qznlMH6WdCcMDxVWlSpMdUVI0Gv3YC.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"偶尔这样也不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/cOBd5jITy1nIUKSEGSWj542XVkSEgPGb.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"老师，在哪里……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/h3fMNBC46rm1XgiTcIka4NPeclYNvmGA.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"希望我能帮上忙。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/3IUJkeYzUFiVLxvc4bpM4ulah1kU1RaV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_commontsaskill","category":"other","text":"尸体……啊，不，伤员请放这边。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%86%B0%E5%AE%A4%20%E6%BF%91%E5%90%8D/U3BWhRElecpOm3uEQzvPqFOEUTkplkZY.ogg"},{"description":"ch0081_eventmission_1","catego